// Page 1 ("About Us") background, embedded as a data URI.
//
// The comparison report is emitted as a single self-contained HTML file that is
// downloaded / uploaded to Drive and opened outside the app, so it cannot
// reference /public. The source asset is public/aboutus-bg.png; this is the same
// artwork at its native 1023x1537 resolution, JPEG-encoded only to keep the
// generated report small.
//
// The artwork carries the ribbon, the six empty boxes with their icon discs, the
// feature strip and its discs. Everything else on page 1 (heading, box copy,
// strip labels, tagline) is live HTML positioned on top - see the .au-* rules in
// page.tsx, whose coordinates were measured out of this image in pixels.
export const ABOUT_US_HERO = 'data:image/jpeg;base64,';
